WEBVTT

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.450
The bad guys who kidnapped us

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.040
wanted to battle Takao's Dragoon.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.550
Takao!

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:54.340
Go Shoot!

00:01:58.430 --> 00:01:59.720
Release it, now!

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.480
In a life-or-death situation,

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:15.030
Takao just barely won by releasing Seiryu.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.360
Who are we fighting against?

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.910
The mysteries keep piling up.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.980
I can't believe a big ship
would just sink like that.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.730
There's an article about it.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:54.940
Off the coast of Sakuya Harbor,
an unidentified cargo ship exploded,

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.820
and submerged in flames.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:00.240
It appears to have been an
unstaffed, unmanned ship...

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.780
Huh?! An unmanned ship?!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.370
No way!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:07.290
Then where did the guys
who lured us out there go?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.660
Don't look at me.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.920
I figured you'd be here.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:13.750
Hiromi!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.210
Takao!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.800
Let me go!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.460
Why are you running?

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:22.300
I thought you were gonna bust me
for ditching cleaning duty again...

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:25.260
That's not it.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.770
I came so you could explain to
me what happened last night.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.230
Who kidnapped us?

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.190
What do they want with you?
And what was that robot?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:37.860
Why does all this dangerous stuff happen
with a stupid spinning top game?

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:39.690
Stupid?

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.110
Yeah!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.610
Stop fighting, you two.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.830
So you explain, Kyoujyu.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.660
Understood.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.040
Come to my house.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:54.500
Here you go.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.290
Ryu-Ryu noodles.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.000
One bowl of Ryu-Ryu noodles!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.210
Comin' right up!

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.220
But to think he made
friends with a girl...

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:09.640
I hope we don't get
any "snow" this time.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.560
I'd like to start by saying
that this is all conjecture,

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:20.610
but I believe that Takao is
being targeted by two enemies.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.280
Two?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.910
Wait a sec. Kyoujyu,

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.740
One of them is that weird
group from last night, right?

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.200
Are there more?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.080
Yes.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.210
The other is that boy
from before, and his team.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.130
This is the boy from
the other day, right?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:42.340
Since the opponents
that beat Max and Rei

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.470
also had the same light
wave come from their Beys

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.720
I believe that they are
all part of one group.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:53.140
The Sacred Beast users with
the invisible Sacred Beasts...

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.310
Indeed.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.730
What's a Sacred Beast?

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.560
Darn them!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.190
They should come two
or three at a time!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.980
I'm gonna win next time!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:05.740
I've got my own Sacred
Beast, Seiryu with me!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.070
Hey, what's a Sacred Beast?

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.370
You should be careful, Takao.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.960
It could be that these two
enemies both want to bait you

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:17.120
into summoning your Sacred Beast.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.630
What do they gain from making me summon my Sacred Beast?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.550
I don't know.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:23.920
No, seriously!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.840
What's a Sacred Beast?

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.510
Shaddup! A Sacred
Beast is a Sacred Beast!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.600
Whatever, I just want my revenge!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.520
I wanna beat that cloaked creep!

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.480
Hey, be quiet up there!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.860
I'm sorry!

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.450
There's one other
thing that bothers me.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:52.620
Since then, I haven't
heard from Max or Rei.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.370
After losing so badly,

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.110
I don't think they'd
be quiet about it.

00:05:58.110 --> 00:05:59.290
You said it.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.670
That, and if our enemies

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:05.260
are after the former members
of the BBA championship team,

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.430
then that means they
might be approaching Kai.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.970
Who's Kai?

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.260
Is it him?

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.270
That's right.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.730
I wonder what he's up to...

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:29.280
I would hope that you would treat your
father with more respect, Master Kai.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:34.580
Even after returning from boarding
school for the first time in ages,

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:39.000
you should at least try to
talk a little more at home.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.150
The rain just won't stop...

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.020
Master Kai!

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.740
Go...

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.700
Shoot!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.870
Darn it!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.000
Go, go, go!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.040
Beat it up!

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.000
Go!

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:32.220
You guys aren't so tough.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.010
Is there anyone stronger--

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.350
Kai,

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.850
You're Kai Hiwatari, right?

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.650
If it's not too much trouble,

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.610
could you show me
some of your moves?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.040
Don't get so buddy-buddy, freshman.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:02.210
There's no way he'd play
around with you guys.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.420
He is one of the best
in the world, after all.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.460
He's not going to
teach you for free.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.720
But I...

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.970
I've always wanted to be
a strong Blader like you.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.090
You're my hero!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.430
So please, even if it's
only for a little...

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:18.850
Look at that!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.440
We told you so, freshman!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:33.320
Sorry for making you mad earlier.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.280
I apologize.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.240
I'm just a freshman,
and I got ahead of myself...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.910
But I really want to...

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.750
I'm Yuya Minami.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.080
Nice to meet you.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.250
Don't...

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.170
follow me around.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:50.880
Got it?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.090
Kai...

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.390
What happened?

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:04.810
Hey, you!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.710
We meet again.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.370
I thought I told you to beat it.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.040
Oh, I will.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.250
After your Dranzer has a battle

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.340
with this, right here.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.800
I sealed off Dranzer.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:41.310
So unseal it! Or I'll do it for you.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.610
Leave me alone.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.860
You're not going anywhere!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.410
Look out!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:03.490
Kai!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:12.710
Get lost!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:13.460
What?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:23.970
Who did this?

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.060
Kai, what happened?

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.380
About Kai...

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.710
You again?

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.000
You're annoying.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.340
Sorry.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.930
Do you know why
Kai gave up Beyblade?

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.140
Just ask him.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.010
I'm stuck because
he won't listen to me.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.430
He doesn't have anyone to fight.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:13.060
Anyone worth fighting.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.360
Yeah.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.110
Someone who could give the world
champ a run for his money.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.490
You can't just find someone
like that one so easily.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.740
Think about it, freshman.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.240
Imagine if you were the champion.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.540
What would you do if all of your
opponents were weaker than you?

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.040
Everything gets boring.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.960
Which is why he sealed it...

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.590
I've never seen Kai use Dranzer once,

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.430
not since we've been here.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.260
Yeah.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.760
Imagine if you were the champion.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:49.350
What would you do if all of your
opponents were weaker than you?

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.520
No one worth fighting.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.530
I wonder how that feels?

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:45.990
Sorry!

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.120
I...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.210
Wow!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:00.170
Is this your hideout?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.630
Or your secret training room?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.590
I don't remember inviting you.

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:08.800
I'm sorry. I followed you.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.390
This is...

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.410
Dranzer!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:18.150
Kai, is it true that you
don't have anyone to fight?

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.260
That's what I heard.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.480
Yeah.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.330
Except for one.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:26.070
Who would that be?

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:32.930
A member of the championship-winning BBA team.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.620
Takao Kinomiya.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.780
How strange.
I feel empowered.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.050
Whenever I think of him...

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.840
Go, Dragoon!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.260
I wanna see it.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.520
I want to see you battle with passion!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:58.480
We've got uninvited company.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:17.870
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.960
Jump!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.300
I can't!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.050
Come on!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.820
Are you okay? Hey!

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:43.730
Yeah.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.490
Damn. He got away.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.420
I'm sorry, Kai.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.670
I disobeyed you and
caused a lot of trouble.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.550
Who was he?

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.970
Why is he after you?

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.180
Beats me.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.600
Is he not worth fighting?

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:34.660
Excuse me Kai, do you know
what that freshman's up to?

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.750
You know, since he bothered you,

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.830
he said he was
gonna make up for it.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:43.750
I think he went out
somewhere this morning.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:44.920
Make up for it?

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:49.420
He said he was going to go
take a challenge in your place

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:53.300
or some nonsense like
that to his roommate.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:56.010
We kept telling
him he was full of it,

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.140
but we--

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.950
Kai Hiwatari...

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.700
Today, we're going to
put an end to this.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.200
At three in the afternoon.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.640
I'll be waiting on the
roof of Alpha Tower.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.810
Come on, let's go!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.770
I'm not here to
fight you, ya brat.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.860
Where's Kai?

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.530
I'm his backup!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.150
That's why I have Dranzer!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.950
How did you...

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.160
Kai...

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.160
Stop.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.330
I'm sorry.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.370
But I...

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.090
Hand that over to Kai, kid.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.210
No!

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.800
I'll fight like Kai...

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.630
I'll fight for Kai!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:14.720
That's enough.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:17.640
Didn't you say you
didn't have any opponents?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.260
That means I can fight him!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.470
Suit yourself.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.480
Don't blame me if
something goes wrong.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.520
I don't care who's first.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.150
I will fight you!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.530
Go Shoot!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.650
I'm gonna knock you down a peg!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.530
Go Shoot!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.450
Go, Dranzer!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.660
What's the matter, kid?

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.920
That championship-winning
Bey is shedding tears.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.050
Darn it!

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.790
Dranzer!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.760
What's the problem, Dranzer?

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.590
Attack! You have to attack!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.350
Am I not good enough?

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:04.060
Darn!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.140
Playtime's over!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.940
Spark Hammer!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:14.900
What?!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.540
Don't look down!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.220
Bastard...

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:45.970
Just goes to show that Dranzer
is trash unless you use it.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.610
Finally in the mood, are you?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.860
Just one match.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.660
Yeah. That's all I want.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.620
Your style of Beyblading disgusts me.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.660
Why thank you, sir.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:10.790
Let's do this.

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.630
Go Shoot!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.430
What?!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.300
I've got more!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.480
Incredible...

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.480
This is how Kai uses Dranzer...

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.330
Is that all?

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.790
Is it?

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:51.250
The more into it you get,

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.840
the more powerful I feel!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:56.920
Come on!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.430
But how?

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:09.140
Where is that power coming from?

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.480
That light...

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.190
Dranzer is getting sucked in...

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.150
Come on down, Dranzer!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.650
Stop, Dranzer!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.740
Dranzer!!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.990
This is the end for you!

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:56.440
You win for now.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.440
Hope you're ready next time.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:07.910
Kai...?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.910
I'm bringing Dranzer back.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.790
A worthwhile opponent
has finally shown himself.

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:02.020
The mysterious scientists
behind that robo-Blader!

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:05.780
While we begin our investigation
to find out their identity,

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:07.610
another Blader appears before us!

00:23:07.610 --> 00:23:10.110
What's up with that Bey's
incredible movements?

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:11.660
Tell me, Chairman!

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:14.370
What kind of secrets are
hidden within that Bey?

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:16.490
"If I tell you it won't be a secret"?

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:18.460
This is hardly the time for that!

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:20.710
Anyway, make sure you watch the next episode, okay?
